### Colección de ejemplos (REST Client de VS Code o cliente HTTP de IntelliJ)
### Define las variables en tu entorno local; no escribas contraseñas reales en este archivo.
@base = http://localhost:8080
@email = demo@demo.com
@password = {{$dotenv DEMO_PASSWORD}}

### 1. Login → copia accessToken en @token (dura 15 minutos)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}"}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. Plan de cuentas
GET {{base}}/api/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Periodos del año
GET {{base}}/api/v1/fiscal-periods?year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Abrir un ejercicio (ADMIN)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/fiscal-years/2027/periods
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Crear y contabilizar un asiento (ADMIN o ACCOUNTANT): debe = haber
POST {{base}}/api/v1/journal-entries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-09-24",
  "description": "Venta al contado con IVA 15 %",
  "post": true,
  "lines": [
    {"accountCode": "1010101", "debit": 115.00},
    {"accountCode": "4101", "credit": 100.00, "costCenterCode": "VEN"},
    {"accountCode": "201070101", "credit": 15.00}
  ]
}

### 6. Asiento descuadrado → 422 "El asiento no cuadra"
POST {{base}}/api/v1/journal-entries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"date": "2026-09-24", "description": "Descuadrado", "post": true,
 "lines": [{"accountCode": "1010101", "debit": 100.00}, {"accountCode": "4101", "credit": 99.00}]}

### 7. Reversar un asiento contabilizado (corrección de periodo cerrado)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/journal-entries/1/reverse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"date": "2026-09-24", "reason": "Error en la cuenta"}

### 8. Balance de comprobación (JSON / XLSX / PDF)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/reports/trial-balance?year=2026&fromMonth=1&toMonth=9
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/v1/reports/trial-balance?year=2026&format=XLSX
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Estado de situación financiera al cierre de septiembre
GET {{base}}/api/v1/reports/balance-sheet?year=2026&month=9&level=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Estado de resultados por centro de costo
GET {{base}}/api/v1/reports/income-statement?year=2026&fromMonth=1&toMonth=9&costCenter=ADM&format=PDF
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Libro diario y libro mayor
GET {{base}}/api/v1/reports/journal?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-01-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/v1/reports/ledger?account=1010103&from=2026-01-01&to=2026-09-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Importar plan de cuentas desde CSV (ADMIN)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/accounts/import
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=limite

--limite
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="plan.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./plan-cuentas-ejemplo.csv
--limite--

### 13. Cierre del ejercicio (ADMIN): salda ingresos y gastos contra 30701/30702
POST {{base}}/api/v1/fiscal-years/2026/closing-entry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Evento de facturador-sri (firma HMAC): genera la firma con docs/firmar-evento.sh
POST {{base}}/api/v1/integrations/invoices
Content-Type: application/json
X-Timestamp: {{timestamp}}
X-Signature: {{signature}}

{"invoiceId":"001-001-000000321","issueDate":"2026-09-24","kind":"GOODS","subtotal":100.00,"vat":15.00,"total":115.00}
